<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Output continues despite Sappi mill strike.</title>
<headline>Output continues despite Sappi mill strike.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African paper and pulp producer Sappi Ltd said a strike at its Adamas mill continued for a seventh day on Thursday but production was running normally despite the action.</p>
<p>&quot;Supplies to customers have not been affected,&quot; the company said in  a statement.</p>
<p>Workers at the mill are striking over wages.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
